{"id":7300,"date":"2020-11-15T13:22:08","date_gmt":"2020-11-15T18:22:08","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?p=7300"},"modified":"2020-11-15T13:22:08","modified_gmt":"2020-11-15T18:22:08","slug":"sharing-some-news-from-mexico","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2020\/11\/15\/sharing-some-news-from-mexico\/","title":{"rendered":"Sharing Some News From Mexico"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p>If you&#8217;ve been following along for a while now, you know that we spent a couple of weeks last February visiting Baja California, Mexico.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>We traveled there with the Escapees RV Club Chapter 8 &#8211; The Mexican Connection.  Chapter 8 has been organizing Mexico caravans for nearly four decades now and we found the trip to be exciting and relaxing at the same time.  The countryside was beautiful and our interaction with the locals made the trip all that much more rewarding.  We look forward to the next Chapter 8 trip<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\"><figure class=\"aligncenter size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"468\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/11\/MapBajaCalifornia.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-7301\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/11\/MapBajaCalifornia.jpg 468w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/11\/MapBajaCalifornia-260x300.jpg 260w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 468px) 100vw, 468px\" \/><figcaption>Map of Baja California, Mexico<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/div>\n\n\n\n<p>As a refresher, you can go back and look at some of our posts by <a rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?s=mexico\" target=\"_blank\">following this link<\/a>.  Clicking on this link will bring up a search results page with links to each of the posts I wrote while we were on the trip.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>What I wanted to share with you today is that our caravan Wagonmaster (Kassandra) recently received some pictures from our friend Miguel at La Jolla Beach Camp.  Miguel was not only our host at the beach camp, but was also instrumental in helping to identify local areas of need where we, as travelers and guests to their area might be able to help.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>One of those groups of folks that we so enjoyed getting to meet were the residents of what we here in the states might call an &#8220;assisted living&#8221; center.  In Spanish it&#8217;s called La Casa del Abuelo (Or &#8220;The House Of The Grandfather&#8221;).  I&#8217;m not going to go into a lot of detail here because I&#8217;ve posted about that visit back in February and you can go and refresh your memory by <a rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2020\/02\/28\/giving-back-to-our-hosts\/\" target=\"_blank\">following this link<\/a>.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"768\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/11\/IMG-1210-1024x768.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-7302\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/11\/IMG-1210-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/11\/IMG-1210-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/11\/IMG-1210-768x576.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/11\/IMG-1210-1536x1152.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/11\/IMG-1210-685x514.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/11\/IMG-1210.jpg 720w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><figcaption>Some of the work we did at La Casa del Abuelo included interior insulation and exterior paint<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>But I do want to share with you the pictures that Miguel sent along.  These show how the monies that we donated through our auction and through individual donations have been used to pay for fabrication and installation of the new range hood in the kitchen along with installing new gates on the compound to promote the safety and security of the residents.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery columns-3 is-cropped wp-block-gallery-1 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\"><ul class=\"blocks-gallery-grid\"><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"640\" height=\"480\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/11\/IMG_1516.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"7304\" data-full-url=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/11\/IMG_1516.jpg\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=7304\" class=\"wp-image-7304\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/11\/IMG_1516.jpg 640w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/11\/IMG_1516-300x225.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\" \/><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"640\" height=\"480\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/11\/IMG_1515.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"7303\" data-full-url=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/11\/IMG_1515.jpg\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=7303\" class=\"wp-image-7303\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/11\/IMG_1515.jpg 640w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/11\/IMG_1515-300x225.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\" \/><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"768\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/11\/IMG-20201024-WA0023-1024x768.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"7307\" data-full-url=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/11\/IMG-20201024-WA0023.jpg\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=7307\" class=\"wp-image-7307\" srcset=\"https:\/\/her