s\/2020\/11\/IMG-20201003-WA0016-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/11\/IMG-20201003-WA0016-768x576.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/11\/IMG-20201003-WA0016-685x514.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/11\/IMG-20201003-WA0016.jpg 720w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"768\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/11\/IMG-20201024-WA0026-1024x768.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"7310\" data-full-url=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/11\/IMG-20201024-WA0026.jpg\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=7310\" class=\"wp-image-7310\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/11\/IMG-20201024-WA0026-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/11\/IMG-20201024-WA0026-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/11\/IMG-20201024-WA0026-768x576.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/11\/IMG-20201024-WA0026-685x514.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/11\/IMG-20201024-WA0026.jpg 720w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"768\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/11\/IMG-20201024-WA0028-1-1024x768.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"7311\" data-full-url=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/11\/IMG-20201024-WA0028-1.jpg\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=7311\" class=\"wp-image-7311\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/11\/IMG-20201024-WA0028-1-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/11\/IMG-20201024-WA0028-1-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/11\/IMG-20201024-WA0028-1-768x576.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/11\/IMG-20201024-WA0028-1-685x514.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/11\/IMG-20201024-WA0028-1.jpg 720w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/figure><\/li><\/ul><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-caption\">La Casa del Abuelo improvements that Chapter 8 helped pay for<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>I know that our fellow Chapter 8 members are just as proud as Kathy and me that our efforts and our donations have been put to good use and we look forward to a return trip so as to be able to help even more.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>If you&#8217;re an RV&#8217;er and you&#8217;d like to find out more about Chapter 8 and their caravan to Mexico each year, check out the chapter web site at <a href=\"http:\/\/www.mexicanconnection08.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">www.mexicanconnection08.com<\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>If you&#8217;ve been following along for a while now, you know that we spent a couple of weeks last February visiting Baja California, Mexico. We traveled there with the Escapees RV Club Chapter 8 &#8211; The Mexican Connection. Chapter 8 has been organizing Mexico caravans for nearly four decades now and we found the trip &hellip; <a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2020\/11\/15\/sharing-some-news-from-mexico\/\" class=\"more-link\">Continue reading <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Sharing Some News From Mexico<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[554707839,554707836,554707329,554707760],"tags":[554707912,554707914,554707837,554707911,554707840,554707915,554707913],"class_list":["post-7300","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","hentry","category-escapees","category-mexico","category-traveling","category-volunteering","tag-assisted-living","tag-baja-california","tag-chapter-8","tag-la-casa-del-abuelo","tag-mexican-connection","tag-miguel","tag-nursing-home"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/7300","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=7300"}],"version-history":[{"count":1,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/7300\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":7312,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/7300\/revisions\/7312"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=7300"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=7300"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=7300"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}